@savek-cc  This is already implemented (Nov. 26, 2020).
If you need to clear the transmitter queue, tap on the treatment menu (syringe symbol).  Long press on the microphone symbol at the bottom right corner of the keypad.  Enter "clear transmitter queue" without the quotes.

Please try it.  Unless there is a problem with it, would you please close this issue?
